From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tiberiu Chibici <chibicitiberiu@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:45:54 +0300
Subject: OpenGL 2: GLSL 1.20 shaders in shaders-gl2, loaded instead of shaders
 when there is no OpenGL 3

The 22 shaders, written for the game's OpenGL 2 path (no plugin needed): the same as
shaders/ minus 'in/out/texture', and sprite, batch and outline read the 2D atlas
(Sprite::Atlas) instead of a 3D texture. outlineLite is an 8-lookup version of the
144-lookup outline filter: used when the preference 'Cheap ship outlines' is on or when
the full one does not build.

